ow the end of the tour was (\"I bet it was amazing!\"), and Calvin said the tour was amazing — \"so pumped from all the energy from the audience\" — sharing a photo of a crowd watching a concert with a large screen; Dave: \"Wow, that looks amazing!\" and asked how it was performing on that big stage; Calvin: \"a dream come true\", \"on top of the world\", \"seriously surreal\"; Dave: \"Wow, that must have been an incredible experience! Congrats on achieving such an awesome moment!\"; Calvin said he'd started shooting a video for his new album the weekend before (~2023-08-25/26), sharing a photo of a camera and a video camera on a beach; Dave: \"Can't wait to see it\", and asked \"Will it be shot on location?\"; Calvin: the shoot is in Miami, on an awesome beach — \"It's going to have some epic visuals!\"; the conversation continued with Dave saying the Miami beaches are awesome and that he can't wait to see them, and Calvin saying he loves the Miami vibe, it's \"perfect for the vid\", and \"can't wait to show you!\"; Dave was excited to see the vibe and location and offered to help with props or anything else for the video (\"I'm here to support you!\" / \"let me know when, I'm here to lend a hand. It's great to fuel your ideas.\"); Calvin thanked him, said he'll let Dave know if he needs any assistance with props or anything else, and \"Your support is much appreciated.\" The chat then turned to the photo Dave had sent once of Calvin's custom guitar with an octopus on it — Dave: \"Love how this guitar shows our different artistic styles.\" — and Calvin explained he had it custom made by his Japanese artist friend, that the octopus represents his love for art and the sea, and that it's one of his favorites; Dave: \"That's a great guitar, Calvin! Love the design, it's so unique and special.\", and Calvin: \"Cheers, mate! Really appreciate it. This guitar means so much to me; it's a reminder of my passion for music and the amazing friendships I've made.\"; Dave: \"Wow, Calvin, this instrument obviously means a lot to you - it's like a representation of your journey, your passion for music, and the friendships you've made. Amazing!\"; Calvin: \"It's like every mark and strum holds a story\", sharing a photo of the guitar with a purple glow; Dave marveled at the \"gorgeous purple hue\" and asked why it is so shiny, and Calvin said he had it customized with a shiny finish because it gives it a unique look and goes with his style; Dave: \"Good pick!\" and \"Looks great on you! Your unique style really stands out in your music and playing.\"; Calvin: \"Thanks, dude! I dig how it's so unique. It's totally my style!\", and said that staying true to himself and being unique in his music is something he values, so it's great that Dave appreciates it; Dave then affirmed — \"Definitely, staying true to yourself and your style is vital. It makes you unique and your music stand out. Keep it real, bud. You've got something great to give the world.\" — and re-shared, in that message, a photo of a man working on a car engine in a garage (matches the photo of his shop work he shared on 2023-05-03 — see ## Car maintenance shop) (Calvin's side in the Music video and Octopus guitar sections of /memories/calvin.md) [S16T1][S16T2][S16T3][S16T4][S16T5][S16T6][S16T7][S16T8][S16T9][S16T10][S16T11][S16T12][S16T13][S16T14][S16T15][S16T16][S16T17][S16T18][S16T19][S16T20][S16T21][S16T22][S16T23][S16T24][S16T25].","text_sha256":"a23cd1d9c0e8c6c18d0cfacc6b1678d425a22f5d309b00f56fab4259b84ad187","timestamp":"2023-08-31T14:55:00"}],"integrity":{"post_tree_sha256":"983238fddc77a88ef4ae3d06b50bcfd25a429f497e89c6af4d9477cefca9cad2","pre_tree_sha256":"983238fddc77a88ef4ae3d06b50bcfd25a429f497e89c6af4d9477cefca9cad2","store_unchanged":true,"verified":true},"metrics":{"completion_tokens":835,"filesystem_tool_calls":4,"model_calls":7,"orchestration_calls":3,"prompt_tokens":191309,"provider_request_attempts":7,"provider_rounds":6,"token_usage_available":true,"total_tok